{"title":"Disco Alley","slug":"Disco_Alley","hero":null,"pageid":1899,"revid":8205,"timestamp":"2023-10-29T14:37:04Z","lastEditor":"Tetrahedronal","categories":["Vinyls"],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay Island"},{"label":"Shop","value":"The Oak Depot"},{"label":"Price","value":"$600"},{"label":"Function","value":"Plays music"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.16.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"07/03/2023"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"song","text":"Song"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n\n<p><br>\n<b>Disco Alley</b> is a vinyl created by Kevin Macleod which plays alternative/indie music. \n</p><p>It can be purchased for <b>$600</b> at <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Oak_Depot/\">The Oak Depot</a>. \n</p><p>The name of this vinyl was formerly <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Trapped/\">Trapped</a>. \nTrapped's song changed to <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yaCGUAkSOpg\">Disco Lounge</a> by Kevin Macleod, and the vinyl name changed to <b>Disco Alley</b>. \n</p>\n<h2 id=\"song\">Song</h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: media file\">media file</span></span>\n</p>"}
